                "number": 21,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;What first attracted Terence to the topic of Ife sculptures?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "He read several journal articles."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "He attended an exhibition."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "He spent some time in Nigeria."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 22,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;In his presentation Terence will focus on sculptures featuring",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "abstract designs."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "fish and wild animals."
